ened in 2023 and 2025, have effectively banned the sale of NVIDIA's most powerful data center GPUs — including the H100, H200, and the entire Blackwell generation — to Chinese entities. The Trump administration's March 2026 policy split, which allowed the H200 while banning the Blackwell B100/B200/B300, further complicated the landscape but did not change the fundamental reality: Chinese AI labs have been forced to build their training infrastructure on domestic hardware."}]]}],["$","div","69",{"style":{"overflowX":"auto","margin":"24px 0"},"children":["$","table",null,{"style":{"width":"100%","borderCollapse":"collapse","fontSize":"14px"},"children":[["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[["$","th","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Training Infrastructure"}]]}],["$","th","1",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"GLM-5.1"}]]}],["$","th","2",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"DeepSeek V4"}]]}],["$","th","3",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Kimi K2.6"}]]}],["$","th","4",{"style":{"borderBottom":"2px solid #22d3ee","padding":"12px 16px","textAlign":"left","fontWeight":"600","color":"#22d3ee"},"children":[["$","span","0",{"children":"Qwen 3.7 Max"}]]}]]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[["$","td","0",{"style":{"borderBottom":"1px solid #1a1a1a","padding":"12px 16px","color":"#e5e5e5"},"children":[["$","strong","0",{"style":{"color":"#f5f5f5","fontWeight":"700"},"children":"Primary Hardware"}]]}],["$","td","1",